o, encontre o seu personagem ideal entre 18 classes originais. Cada classe conta com características e feitiços únicos, cuja evolução dependerá da sua maneira de jogar!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215080/extras/f93450e8babd87e11254df2ba7adef47.poster.avif?t=1773070804\" width=624 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215080/extras/f93450e8babd87e11254df2ba7adef47.webm?t=1773070804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215080/extras/f93450e8babd87e11254df2ba7adef47.mp4?t=1773070804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Defina a sua estratégia e trabalhe em equipe para derrotar as criaturas mais sórdidas do Mundo dos Doze. O seu personagem possui diversas características. Cabe a você escolher o seu caminho para se tornar o mais forte e saquear tudo o que puder ao final de cada combate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215080/extras/f00a3920a550b487ccd0479bb6f41dbd.poster.avif?t=1773070804\" width=600 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215080/extras/f00a3920a550b487ccd0479bb6f41dbd.webm?t=1773070804\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215080/extras/f00a3920a550b487ccd0479bb6f41dbd.mp4?t=1773070804\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/215080/extras/b5bb558718f24c0f37d509f3d0fa0305.poster.avif?t=1773070804\" width=624 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c